WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:11.410
Sweetheart. Wow.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.460
I never sleep during the day.

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.480
I've slept through a few, but I don't

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:18.140
nap.

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:22.790
Come on. I got something I want to show

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:28.460
you. Jump on your horse.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.910
This is more your kind of beautiful.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:58.520
I found it a year ago.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:01.280
And you said you wanted to be married

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:04.370
in a place with no memories that we

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:04.880
made em'.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.580
I kind of rushed the wedding, didn't I?

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:12.770
I'm sorry, baby.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:17.210
Yeah. In my defense, I thought I was

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:18.620
going to spend the rest of my life in

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:19.700
prison, so.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.920
And I had to put the pedal to the

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:22.610
metal.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:51.550
F*** you.

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:53.140
You're a good man.

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:20.850
You. Thank you.

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:31.910
All I need now is a cigarette.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.200
You know I'm blowing you anyway.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:42.260
You don't have to work so f***ing hard.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:46.580
Here you are a perfect motherf*****.

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:56.030
I could do this.

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:00.560
I could live here and never see another

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:01.670
person in my whole life.

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:02.480
Except you.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:06.350
Yeah, it might be a little tricky in the

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:07.010
winter, sweetheart.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.150
No, you know what I mean.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.730
I mean, I don't. I don't need anything

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:18.880
else. Cigarettes, whiskey, a meadow.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:20.140
And, you.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.020
Darling, you have a warped sense of

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:24.160
priorities, I'll tell you.

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:25.060
No, I don't.

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:28.360
Three things that make me feel good in

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:29.410
the perfect meadow.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.070
I don't need anything else.

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:35.440
Do you? All right.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.400
You can have a horse.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.130
Well, I need cows to chase her.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.180
There's no reason to ride em.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.480
Fine, you can have a couple of cows.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:42.430
Okay. Thank you.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.170
Now, are you going to need some place to

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:45.400
chase him too, Right?

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:49.260
You're going to make me build a barn in

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:50.400
my perfect meadow.

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:54.200
Beth. No, you know, stop applying logic

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.310
to my perfect daydream.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.080
Please shut the f*** up.

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:01.670
Shut the f*** up and watch that sunset

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.140
with me. Shut the f*** up!

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:06.440
Shut the f*** up! He says to his wife.

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.570
Not shut up. Shut the f*** up.

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:09.170
You know.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:16.710
F*** your sunset, baby.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:22.740
You watch me.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:27.110
Sunsets are overrated anyway.

